---LINES

mainv   = gh    -       -       -       -     "main view"
mainvk  = gv    -       -       -       -     "main view keys:"

cmded   = gh    -       -       -       -     "command editor"
cmdedk  = gv    -       -       -       -     "command editor keys:"

exit    = gh    -       -       -       -     "exit code indicator"
exitk   = gv    -       -       -       -     "exit code indicator keys:"

hist    = gh    -       -       -       -     "history view"
histk   = gv    -       -       -       -     "history view keys:"

runcmd  = gv    -       -       -       -     "\\_run_a_command_\\.........."
m       = gm    -       -       -       -     " *)"


---SCREEN
=vash workflow diagram
                                       .mainvk.................................
           .'lowercase, also '.' or '/' - type unix command from scratch    {1}
				      .'uppercase, digit, and any other: 
 .mainv.............................      - edit a command from template    {2} 
 ^  ^            .'[a-z./] .'[A-Z0-9]   or - execute the command profiled **{3}
 :  :    .m            :     :    :    
 :  :   .hist......... :     :    :    .histk..................................
 : .:CA.. ^   .:NL...  :     :    :    .:NL... - take a command to editor    .m
 :  :     :   .:CA..  {1}    :    :    .:CA... - return to editor untouched
 :  :     :     :      :    {2}   :    
 :  v   .:HE..  :      :     :   {3}   .cmdedk.................................
 :  .cmded......................  :    .:NL... - run a command, sync history .m
 :       ^    .:NL...             :    .:HE... - search in history view        
 :       :      :                 :    .:CA... - switch between main view and 
.:SP...  :      .runcmd............         command editor, keeping both states
.:CA..  .m              :              
 .exit....................             .exitk..................................
         -->  .:NL...                  .:SP..., .:CA... - return to main view  
                                        any key - return to command editor   .m
                                       .:NL... - defencive trap for mistakes   
    .m. see 'man vash' for details
                                       
---END                                 
=vash, visual assistant for shell (C) 1990-1993,2018-2022 vsv
 may be vary, depending of profile in use 

